  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Deadie_vimpalen.jpg\" title=\"Deadie VimPalen\"><img alt=\"Deadie VimPalen\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"320\" src=\"/images/Deadie_vimpalen.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Deadie_vimpalen.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Deadie VimPalen</div></div></div>\n<p>Deadie VimPalen is the namesake <a href=\"/wiki/Champion\" title=\"Champion\">Champion</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">Deadie VimPalen's Pad</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a> Level 4.  He is a giant barbarian with a huge axe or instrument, and usually accompanied by swarms of Poison <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Oroks\" title=\"Category:Oroks\">Oroks</a> of various sorts.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
